&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;c．受注実績&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 42px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;　当社は受注生産を行っておりませんので、該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;d．販売実績&lt;/p&gt;
